---
import "../../styles/animations.css";
---

<figure class="an-wrap">
  <svg class="an de" viewBox="0 0 480 248" role="img" aria-label="Jobs wait in a delayed queue and move to a worker as each becomes due"><rect class="nd " x="16" y="24" width="220" height="112" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="26" y="33" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="137.0" y="49" text-anchor="middle">Delayed queue</text><rect class="nd " x="344" y="40" width="120" height="80" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="354" y="49" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="415.0" y="65" text-anchor="middle">Worker</text><path class="ln" d="M236 80 L344 80"/><g class="de-w0"><rect x="32" y="78" width="58" height="40" rx="8" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--c2)" stroke-width="1.5"/><text class="sm m" x="61" y="103" text-anchor="middle">+3s</text></g><g class="de-w1"><rect x="98" y="78" width="58" height="40" rx="8" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--c2)" stroke-width="1.5"/><text class="sm m" x="127" y="103" text-anchor="middle">+6s</text></g><g class="de-w2"><rect x="164" y="78" width="58" height="40" rx="8" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--c2)" stroke-width="1.5"/><text class="sm m" x="193" y="103" text-anchor="middle">+9s</text></g><g class="de-w3"><circle class="pk" cx="236" cy="80" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:108px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><g class="de-w4"><circle class="pk" cx="236" cy="80" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:108px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><g class="de-w5"><circle class="pk" cx="236" cy="80" r="5" fill="var(--c1)" style="--dx:108px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.2s!important;"/></g><rect x="16" y="160" width="448" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--surface-2)"/><rect x="16" y="160" height="8" rx="4" fill="var(--c2)" style="width:0;animation-name:de-bar"/><text class="sm m" x="16" y="190">now</text><text class="sm m" x="464" y="190" text-anchor="end">+12s</text><g class="de-w6 an-fin"><text class="sm" x="404" y="142" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">3 jobs done</text></g><rect class="cap" x="16" y="206" width="448" height="38" rx="10"/><g class="de-w8"><text x="240.0" y="230" text-anchor="middle">Jobs wait, hidden, until their time comes.</text></g><g class="de-w9"><text x="240.0" y="230" text-anchor="middle">A job is due: ZPOPBYSCORE hands it to a worker.</text></g><g class="de-w7"><text x="240.0" y="230" text-anchor="middle">Each due job is taken once, by one worker.</text></g><g class="de-w6 an-fin"><text x="240.0" y="230" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--ok)">Nothing is polled, nothing is run early.</text></g></svg>
  <figcaption><b>Delayed jobs that run on time</b>ZPOPBYSCORE and ZMOVEDUE take only the members whose time has come, in one command.</figcaption>
</figure>
